# Copy to `.env` for local overrides. Vite exposes only names prefixed with `VITE_`.
# Values are inlined at **build time** (`npm run build`); set the same keys in Netlify
# (Site configuration → Environment variables) so production bundles include them.

# Sentry browser SDK DSN (from Sentry project → Client Keys). Omit or leave empty for no telemetry.
# VITE_SENTRY_DSN=

# Public path the app is served under (Vite `base`). Default is `/`.
# VITE_PUBLIC_URL=/
